<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6627" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">căpĭtātus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>having a head</i> (rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">clavulus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 9, 15</span></i>
			: et crassa natrix, Lucil. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. p.
				65, 31</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caepa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					19, 6, 32, § 105</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">porrum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					20, 6, 22, § 48</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Pall. Febr. 24, 11</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">herba,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					24, 19, 113, § 173</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cunila,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					32, 10, 44, § 126</span></i>
			: vinea, <i>a vine that grows in a head</i>
			(opp. bracchiata), <i><span class="en">Col. 5, 5, 9</span></i> and 11.</div>
